{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"farm_field_t2","model_identifier":"farm_field_t2","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# farm_field_t2\n\nFarm field tier 2: a split-rail fence, dug rows and a small tool shed in the corner.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 8 columns (128 x 128 units, 3.60 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -64..64, y -0..38, z -64..64 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 64, construction_0 23, construction_33 23, construction_66 23, ruined 27 (7 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 127 x 38 x 127 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `farm_field_t2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `farm_field_t2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_farm_field_t2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -70)\n- `slot_row_1` at (-48, 3, 0)\n- `slot_row_2` at (-32, 3, 0)\n- `slot_row_3` at (-16, 3, 0)\n- `slot_row_4` at (0, 3, 0)\n- `slot_row_5` at (16, 3, 0)\n- `slot_row_6` at (32, 3, 0)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Rows run along Z (6 rows of 16 u); the shed fills the east strip.\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"row_bed","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56.0,0.0,-56.0],"to":[40.0,1.0,56.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,191.0,96.0,192.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[65.0,189.0,177.0,190.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,191.0,96.0,192.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[65.0,189.0,177.0,190.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,100.0,112.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,100.0,112.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"23f98a84-1723-518c-8794-d2d67fb4b654"},{"name":"row0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-53.0,1.0,-56.0],"to":[-43.0,3.0,56.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[244.0,187.0,254.0,189.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,183.0,112.0,185.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[244.0,187.0,254.0,189.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,183.0,112.0,185.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[100.0,0.0,110.0,112.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[100.0,0.0,110.0,112.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"09e8543d-82dc-5dd4-9f78-e65fd6f72c46"},{"name":"row0_top","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-51.0,3.0,-56.0],"to":[-45.0,4.5,56.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[30.0,189.5,36.0,191.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[112.0,183.5,224.0,185.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[30.0,189.5,36.0,191.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[112.0,183.5,224.0,185.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[140.0,0.0,146.0,112.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[140.